      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170401007401_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170401007401_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170401007401_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/match1867455date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英格兰6-4法国获季军 萨卡戴帽姆巴佩双响创纪录奥利塞2助+失良机</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260719/zhanbao_image_1867455_1784415764_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260719/zhanbao_image_1867455_1784415764_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260719/zhanbao_image_1867455_1784415764_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span>英格兰6-4击败法国获得季军，英格兰创造队史近60年世界杯最佳战绩。姆巴佩贡献两个进球和一次助攻，独享世界杯历史射手榜纪录。</span></p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/6a5bfe80284aanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">独占历史第1！姆巴佩双响本届10球4助，历史总进球22球超越梅西！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c0c4a08d25.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c0c4a08d25.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c0c4a08d25.jpg"> </div><p><span>世界杯三四名决赛法国vs英格兰比赛中，姆巴佩打入2球，在本届射手榜上超越梅西，同时在个人总进球榜上超越梅西，独占历史第一！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/6a5c013b75b65native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大赛1冠2亚！德尚执教法国队14年谢幕，最后一舞收获世界杯殿军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c0a5aee039.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c0a5aee039.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c0a5aee039.jpg"> </div><p><span>美加墨世界杯三四名决赛，法国不敌英格兰，德尚法国队最后一舞以殿军谢幕。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/6a5bf757dbe7anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">成功复仇！英格兰胜法国获世界杯季军，队史近60年世界杯最好成绩</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/6a5c02749a898native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">殿军收官！法国遭英格兰复仇，近三届世界杯分获冠、亚、殿军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.55" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5beb3c19d3d_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.55" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.55" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5beb3c19d3d_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5beb3c19d3d_1280.jpg"> </div><p><span>美加墨世界杯季军赛，英格兰战胜法国，夺得本届世界杯季军，法国获得殿军。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/6a5be60336cfenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">只差前2！世界杯最终排名第3-48：英格兰第3法国第4 挪威5比利时6</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.3" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/202607190736506969.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.3" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.3" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/202607190736506969.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/202607190736506969.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">世界杯三四名决赛结束，英格兰6-4法国获得季军，法国最终殿军收官。至此，除开明天的最终决赛，本届世界杯48队中46队的名次均已确定。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/6a5bff0857dc1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">金靴花落谁家？世界杯射手榜：姆巴佩10球暂第1，梅西8球明晨决赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5bfbe0815ef_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5bfbe0815ef.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5bfbe0815ef.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">世界杯季军赛结束，本场姆巴佩2射1传。本届世界杯赛事，姆巴佩以10球4助收官，目前暂居射手榜第一。梅西目前8球4助，暂居射手榜第二位。明天凌晨，梅西需要打进2球+助攻，或者打进3球以上才能反超。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/6a5c071ba704enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">见证历史！英格兰6-4法国是第6场进球10+的世界杯比赛 近44年首场</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/202607190708236680_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/202607190708236680_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/202607190708236680_1280.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯三四名决赛法国 4-6 英格兰！凭借10个进球，这场比赛是自1982年以来世界杯上首场进球数达到10个或以上的比赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/6a5c0646a4734native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">创造历史！英法大战两队合计狂轰10球，创世界杯季军赛进球数纪录</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260719/zhanbao_image_1867455_1784415764_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260719/zhanbao_image_1867455_1784415764_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260719/zhanbao_image_1867455_1784415764_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">据数据统计，此前世界杯三四名决赛的单场最高进球纪录为9球，由1958年瑞典世界杯上法国6-3击败西德的比赛创造，该纪录已尘封近70年。本场双方联手贡献10球，正式将这一历史数字推至新高。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/6a5ba5d6cbcd1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：小蜘蛛对阵瑞士世界波，当选世界杯8强至4强阶段最佳进球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a53128b7506e_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a53128b7506e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a53128b7506e.jpg"> </div><p><span>FIFA官方消息，阿尔瓦雷斯在阿根廷vs瑞士比赛中打进的世界波进球，当选为赛事8强、4强阶段的票选最佳进球。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-18/6a5b9922e3c62native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">冲击卫冕！梅西晒身披阿根廷国旗照片：最后的探戈，向着决赛进发</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.39" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607182318354200.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.39" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.39" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607182318354200.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260718/202607182318354200.jpg"> </div><p><span>世界杯决赛，西班牙vs阿根廷。梅西于今日发布社媒，晒出了自己身披阿根廷国旗的照片，并配文：我们正一起经历着一段怎样的旅程啊，带着“最后的探戈”，向着决赛进发，加油阿根廷！！！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-19/6a5bb1e2961f1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">天空：阿根廷若赢得世界杯，将被白宫工作组允许再次展示马岛横幅</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/6a598a2ab988f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-i